--- stdout
Replace this Iris with a published release.

Usage: iris self update [FLAGS] [VERSION]

Arguments:
  [VERSION]  Release to install, such as v0.1.6. Defaults to the latest release on this Iris's channel.

Flags:
      --stable  Follow stable releases. This is the default for stable releases.
      --canary  Follow canary builds of the main branch. This is the default for canary builds.
      --check   Report whether another release is available without installing it. Exits with 100 when one is.
  -h, --help    Print help
